---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { shareQr } from '../scripts/shareqr';
import { WX, wxDays } from '../scripts/weather';

const extras = [
  { icon: 'note', label: 'Note' },
  { icon: 'grid', label: 'GitHub graph' },
  { icon: 'folder', label: 'File tray' },
  { icon: 'volume', label: 'Volume' },
  { icon: 'timer', label: 'Timer' },
  { icon: 'pipette', label: 'Color picker' },
  { icon: 'calendar', label: 'Scheduled tasks' },
] as const;
---
<section id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Features</span>
      <h2>Hover to open<br />your tools.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Clipboard history, agent sessions and everything below, one hover away. Don't need something? Switch it off in Settings and QNotch won't even load it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      <article class="card f-agents">
        <div class="viz">
          <div class="v-row"><span class="v-ico warn"><Icon name="terminal" /></span><div><b>Rate limit the upload endpoint</b><span class="warn">api · Claude needs your permission to use Bash</span></div><em>$2.14</em><button class="v-btn warn-btn" data-v="answer">Answer</button></div>
          <div class="v-row"><span class="v-ico ok"><Icon name="terminal" /></span><div><b>Upload form in the new design</b><span>web · Working for 6m</span><i class="v-chip">4 processes · 484 MB · :3000</i></div><em>$1.72</em></div>
          <div class="v-row"><span class="v-ico ok"><Icon name="terminal" /></span><div><b>Fix the flaky checkout test</b><span>Codex · shop · Working for 2m</span></div></div>
          <div class="v-row thin"><div><b>node astro.mjs dev</b><span>Left running · 210 MB · :4321</span></div><button class="v-btn" data-v="stop">Stop</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="txt">
          <h3>See when an agent is waiting on you.</h3>
          <p>I kept coming back to terminals that had been sitting on a yes/no question for 20 minutes, so I built this. The pill shows every Claude Code and Codex session by title and status. When one needs you, it widens and plays a sound. Click it and you're straight back in that session.</p>
          <p>See today's token usage for each Claude Code session. Check the dev servers a session left running and stop them with a button.</p>
          <button class="try" data-try="agent">Try it in the demo <Icon name="arrow" /></button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card f-notify">
        <div class="viz code">
          <code><span class="c-k">QNotch.exe</span> notify <span class="c-s">"Build finished"</span> <span class="c-s">"142 tests passed"</span> <span class="c-f">--level</span> success</code>
          <div class="v-toast"><span class="v-ico ok"><Icon name="check" /></span><div><b>Build finished</b><span>142 tests passed</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="txt">
          <h3>Send notifications from scripts.</h3>
          <p>Post through the command line, a named pipe or local HTTP. Add buttons and wait for the user's answer.</p>
          <button class="try" data-try="notify">Try it <Icon name="arrow" /></button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card f-media">
        <div class="viz">
          <div class="v-media"><span class="v-art"></span><div><b>Midnight City</b><span>M83</span><i class="v-track"><i style="width:34%"></i></i></div><button class="v-play" data-v="play" aria-label="Play or pause"><span class="pa"><Icon name="pause" /></span><span class="pl"><Icon name="play" /></span></button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="txt">
          <h3>Control your music.</h3>
          <p>See the track and artwork. Pause or skip media playing in Spotify, your browser or another media app.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card f-clip">
        <div class="viz">
          <div class="v-clip"><Icon name="link" class="i acc" /><span class="acc">github.com/Somafet/qnotch</span></div>
          <div class="v-clip"><Icon name="code" class="i acc" /><code>dotnet build -c Release</code></div>
          <div class="v-clip"><Icon name="pipette" class="i acc" /><span><i class="v-sw"></i>#5B9DFF</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="txt">
          <h3>Find something you copied.</h3>
          <p>Keep a history of copied text, code, links and images. Pin entries to keep them. History stays in memory unless you choose to save it.</p>
          <button class="try" data-try="clipboard">Try it <Icon name="arrow" /></button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card f-search">
        <div class="viz">
          <div class="v-search"><Icon name="search" /><span>deploy<i class="v-caret"></i></span></div>
          <div class="v-hit"><Icon name="bell" class="i acc" /><span>Deploy to staging failed</span><small>Notifications</small></div>
          <div class="v-hit"><Icon name="copy" class="i acc" /><span>npm run deploy -- --prod</span><small>Clipboard</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="txt">
          <h3>Search across the panel.</h3>
          <p>Press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> <kbd>Alt</kbd> <kbd>F</kbd> to search clipboard history, files, notes, notifications, tasks, tabs and settings.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card f-game">
        <div class="viz game">
          <div class="v-bar"><b>Midnight City</b> · M83 <span><em>CPU</em> 13%</span><span class="opt"><em>GPU</em> 61% 71°C</span><span><em>RAM</em> 21.2/31.9 GB</span><b>21:09</b></div>
        </div>
        <div class="txt">
          <h3>Keep stats visible during games.</h3>
          <p>When a game or fullscreen video is running, QNotch shrinks to one status line, ignores hover and lets clicks straight through. Missed shots are on you now.</p>
          <button class="try" data-try="game">Try it <Icon name="arrow" /></button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card f-share">
        <div class="viz">
          <div class="v-share">
            <div class="v-qr" set:html={shareQr} />
            <div class="v-session">
              <b>Ends in 14 min</b>
              <span>Phone connected.</span>
              <div class="v-xfer"><Icon name="arrow" class="i acc" /><div><b>screenshot-0927.png</b><small class="ok">Sent</small></div></div>
              <div class="v-xfer"><Icon name="download" class="i acc" /><div><b>IMG_2044.jpg</b><small class="ok">Saved to Downloads\QNotch</small></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="txt">
          <h3>Send files to your phone and back.</h3>
          <p>Scan the code and your phone's browser can grab files from the tray or send photos back to Downloads\QNotch. No app, no account.</p>
          <p>Fair warning: it's plain HTTP over your local network, not encrypted, and the link dies after 15 minutes unless you extend it.</p>
          <button class="try" data-try="share">Try it <Icon name="arrow" /></button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card f-mic">
        <div class="viz">
          <div class="v-pill"><Icon name="mic" class="i warn" /><Icon name="camera" class="i warn" /><span class="dim">In a call</span><span><em>CPU</em> 9%</span><b>10:02</b></div>
        </div>
        <div class="txt">
          <h3>See when apps use your mic or camera.</h3>
          <p>The pill shows an icon while an app uses your microphone or camera. QNotch silences notification alerts during calls.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card f-ai">
        <div class="viz">
          <div class="v-usage"><span>Claude Code · 5h</span><i class="v-track"><i style="width:62%"></i></i><small>62%</small></div>
          <div class="v-usage"><span>Codex · week</span><i class="v-track"><i style="width:28%"></i></i><small>28%</small></div>
          <div class="v-banked"><Icon name="bolt" class="i acc" />2 banked resets · next expires in 5 days</div>
        </div>
        <div class="txt">
          <h3>Launch AI apps with a shortcut.</h3>
          <p>Use <kbd>Alt</kbd> <kbd>1</kbd> through <kbd>Alt</kbd> <kbd>6</kbd> to launch your AI apps. Check Claude Code and Codex usage limits and your remaining banked resets.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card f-weather">
        <div class="viz">
          <div class="v-wx">
            <img src={WX.icon} width="48" height="48" alt="" />
            <div><b>{WX.temp}</b><span>{WX.condition}</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="v-wx-place">{WX.place} · {WX.detail}</div>
          <div class="v-wx-days">
            {wxDays().map((d, i) => (
              <div title={d.tip}><span data-wxday={i}>{d.name}</span><img src={d.icon} width="28" height="28" alt={d.tip} /><b>{d.high}</b> <em>{d.low}</em></div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="txt">
          <h3>Check the weather.</h3>
          <p>Pick your town and get the yr.no forecast: right now and the next three days on Home, plus the temperature in the pill and the game bar. No account or API key.</p>
          <button class="try" data-try="open">Try it <Icon name="arrow" /></button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card f-extras">
        <div class="txt">
          <h3>More tools and settings.</h3>
          <ul class="extras">
            {extras.map(x => <li><Icon name={x.icon} />{x.label}</li>)}
          </ul>
          <p>Drag the pill sideways or onto another display. QNotch remembers its position for each app. In Edit mode, drag Home cards and tabs to reorder them.</p>
          <p>Choose an audio file for each alert. Copy your appearance, layout and shortcut settings as a setup code to use on another PC.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { wxDayName } from '../scripts/weather';

  // The small app pieces in these cards work too.
  document.querySelector('[data-v="stop"]')?.addEventListener('click', e => {
    const b = e.currentTarget as HTMLButtonElement;
    b.closest('.v-row')!.classList.add('stopped');
    b.textContent = 'Stopped';
    b.disabled = true;
  });
  document.querySelector('[data-v="answer"]')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    document.getElementById('demo')?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
    setTimeout(() => document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-scenario="agent"]')?.click(), 500);
  });
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-wxday]').forEach(e => (e.textContent = wxDayName(Number(e.dataset.wxday))));
  document.querySelector('[data-v="play"]')?.addEventListener('click', e => (e.currentTarget as HTMLElement).classList.toggle('paused'));

  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-try]').forEach(b => b.addEventListener('click', () => {
    document.getElementById('demo')?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
    setTimeout(() => {
      const chip = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-scenario="${b.dataset.try}"]`);
      if (chip) chip.click();
      else document.getElementById('demo')?.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('scenario', { detail: b.dataset.try }));
    }, 500);
  }));
</script>

<style>
  .bento {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .bento .card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .f-agents { grid-column: span 4; }
  .f-notify { grid-column: span 2; }
  .f-media, .f-clip, .f-search { grid-column: span 2; }
  .f-game, .f-share { grid-column: span 3; }
  .f-mic, .f-ai, .f-weather { grid-column: span 2; }
  .f-extras { grid-column: 1 / -1; justify-content: center; }

  .txt {
    padding: 0 12px 12px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .txt p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 15.5px;
  }

  .txt kbd {
    height: 22px;
    min-width: 22px;
    padding: 0 6px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    vertical-align: 1px;
  }

  .try {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .try :global(.i) {
    width: 15px;
    height: 15px;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .try:hover :global(.i) { transform: translateX(3px); }

  /* Mini app UI */
  .viz {
    --t1: #f4f4f7;
    --t2: #a1a1ad;
    --t3: #6f6f7b;
    --acc: #5b9dff;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    min-height: 184px;
    padding: 18px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(80% 120% at 50% 130%, rgba(91, 157, 255, 0.35), transparent 70%),
      #0b0b0d;
    color: var(--t1);
    font: 13px/1.4 'Segoe UI Variable Text', 'Segoe UI', 'Inter Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .viz :global(.i) { width: 1em; height: 1em; }
  .viz :global(.acc), .viz .acc { color: var(--acc); }
  .viz :global(.warn), .viz .warn { color: #ffb74d; }
  .viz .dim { color: var(--t2); }

  .v-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border-radius: 11px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .v-row > div { flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .v-row b { font-weight: 600; }
  .v-row span { color: var(--t2); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .v-row em { font-style: normal; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--t2); }
  .v-row.thin { padding: 7px 12px; }

  .v-ico {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 9px;
    font-size: 17px;
    background: rgba(76, 217, 140, 0.14);
    color: #4cd98c;
  }

  .v-ico.warn { background: rgba(255, 183, 77, 0.14); color: #ffb74d; }

  .v-chip {
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding: 1px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    color: var(--t2);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .v-row.stopped { opacity: 0.45; }
  .v-row b { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .warn-btn { background: rgba(255, 183, 77, 0.16); color: #ffb74d !important; font-weight: 600; }

  .v-banked {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 4px;
    color: var(--t2);
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  .v-play .pl, .v-play.paused .pa { display: none; }
  .v-play.paused .pl { display: contents; }
  .v-play .pa { display: contents; }

  .v-btn {
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: var(--t1) !important;
  }

  .viz.code code {
    font: 12px/1.6 var(--mono);
    color: #d6d6de;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  .c-k { color: #5b9dff; }
  .c-s { color: #4cd98c; }
  .c-f { color: #a1a1ad; }

  .v-toast {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #141418;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    animation: pop 3.6s ease infinite;
  }

  .v-toast div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .v-toast span { color: var(--t2); font-size: 12px; }

  @keyframes pop {
    0%, 12% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-6px); }
    20%, 85% { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    100% { opacity: 0; }
  }

  .v-media {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .v-media > div { flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .v-media b { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
  .v-media div > span { color: var(--t2); }

  .v-art {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    flex: none;
    border-radius: 11px;
    background: linear-gradient(140deg, #ff6aa2, #8a5cff 50%, #1e2a6e);
  }

  .v-play {
    cursor: pointer;
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--acc);
    color: #0b0b0d;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .v-play :global(svg) { stroke-width: 3; }

  .v-track {
    display: block;
    height: 4px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .v-track i { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--acc); border-radius: 4px; }

  .v-clip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .v-clip code { font: 12px var(--mono); }

  .v-sw {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    margin-right: 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #5b9dff;
    vertical-align: -1px;
  }

  .v-search {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    height: 40px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    border-radius: 11px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(91, 157, 255, 0.55);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: var(--t2);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .v-search span { color: var(--t1); font-size: 13.5px; }

  .v-caret {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1.5px;
    height: 15px;
    margin-left: 1px;
    vertical-align: -3px;
    background: var(--t1);
    animation: blink 1s steps(1) infinite;
  }

  @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }

  .v-hit {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .v-hit:first-of-type { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); }
  .v-hit span { flex: 1; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .v-hit small { color: var(--t3); font-size: 11.5px; }

  .viz.game {
    align-items: center;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 55%, rgba(255, 61, 141, 0.35)),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #120533, #3a0d63 70%, #8a1f6a);
  }

  .v-bar, .v-pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    align-self: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
    background: #0b0b0d;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-top: 0;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
  }

  .v-bar {
    height: 28px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    border-radius: 0 0 11px 11px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    background: rgba(20, 20, 26, 0.92);
  }

  .v-bar em, .v-pill em { font-style: normal; color: var(--t2); }
  .v-bar b { font-weight: 600; }

  .v-pill {
    height: 38px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    border-radius: 0 0 15px 15px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .v-pill :global(.i) { font-size: 16px; }
  .v-pill b { font-weight: 600; }

  .f-mic .viz::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 56px 18px 18px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14) 0 22px, transparent 23px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 70% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 0 22px, transparent 23px),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }

  .v-usage {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 4px 10px;
    padding: 8px 4px;
  }

  .v-usage span { color: var(--t2); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .v-usage .v-track { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0; order: 3; }
  .v-usage small { font-weight: 600; }

  .v-share {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .v-qr {
    width: 128px;
    height: 128px;
    flex: none;
    padding: 2px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .v-qr :global(svg) { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }

  .v-session { flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .v-session > b { font-weight: 600; }
  .v-session > span { margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--t2); font-size: 12.5px; }

  .v-xfer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 6px 0;
  }

  .v-xfer > div { min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .v-xfer b { overflow: hidden; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 500; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .v-xfer small { font-size: 11.5px; }
  .v-xfer .ok { color: #4cd98c; }

  .v-wx { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .v-wx div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .v-wx b { font-size: 28px; line-height: 32px; font-weight: 600; }
  .v-wx span { color: var(--t2); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .v-wx-place { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--t3); font-size: 12px; }

  .v-wx-days {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .v-wx-days div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; font-size: 12px; }
  .v-wx-days span { color: var(--t2); }
  .v-wx-days img { margin: 3px 0; }
  .v-wx-days b { font-weight: 600; }
  .v-wx-days em { font-style: normal; color: var(--t3); }

  .f-extras .txt { padding: 18px; gap: 16px; }

  .extras {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .extras li {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 38px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

